import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 605 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Dragon Ball | Goku's Cultivation Time Waste","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 605 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Dragon Ball | Goku's Cultivation Time Waste","no":605,"module":3,"tags":["Dual-Track Time Domain","Dragon Ball","Goku","Hyperbolic Time Chamber","Time Waste","Cross-Heavens Benchmark"],"related":["16-Multiplication Fruit Technical Principle","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0605_模块3-双轨时间域vs龙珠-悟空修炼时间浪费.md","filePath":"en/0605_模块3-双轨时间域vs龙珠-悟空修炼时间浪费.md"}`),n={name:"en/0605_模块3-双轨时间域vs龙珠-悟空修炼时间浪费.md"};function r(l,e,s,c,u,h){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-605-dual-track-time-domain-vs-dragon-ball-goku-s-cultivation-time-waste" tabindex="-1">Entry 605 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Dragon Ball | Goku&#39;s Cultivation Time Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-605-dual-track-time-domain-vs-dragon-ball-goku-s-cultivation-time-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 605 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Dragon Ball | Goku&#39;s Cultivation Time Waste&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 16, 04, 15 | Series: Cross-Heavens Time-View Benchmark (Entry 5)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-year-in-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber-why-only-one-person-trained" tabindex="-1">Introduction: one year in the Hyperbolic Time Chamber, why only one person trained <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-year-in-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber-why-only-one-person-trained" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: one year in the Hyperbolic Time Chamber, why only one person trained&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s &quot;Hyperbolic Time Chamber&quot; is anime history&#39;s most famous time-acceleration device — one year inside, one day outside. Goku and Gohan father-son enter seclusion, emerge with explosive power growth. This setting is almost the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s prototype, highly imaginative. But Heng Yuan Zhou must ask: <strong>since there is such a useful acceleration chamber, why for decades only the protagonist father-son occasionally enter to train?</strong></p><p>Six top-level axioms are the criterion of this question: anti-predation axiom requires acceleration devices not only serve the protagonist&#39;s family; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires time-acceleration qualification equal to all warriors; collective ascension axiom requires acceleration gains convert to the whole civilization&#39;s combat power; causal self-discipline axiom requires time-acceleration use not create &quot;protagonist always ahead&quot; causal gap; law-first axiom requires &quot;why the acceleration chamber is only for the protagonist&quot; explained by law, not plot default. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry dissects Dragon-Ball-style time acceleration&#39;s structural waste and gives the dual alternative.</p><h2 id="i-time-structure-of-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber" tabindex="-1">I. Time Structure of the Hyperbolic Time Chamber <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-time-structure-of-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Time Structure of the Hyperbolic Time Chamber&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s acceleration-device structure looks simple, but hides monopoly:</p><ol><li><strong>One room</strong>: extremely small space, limited simultaneous capacity, and year-round open only to the protagonist&#39;s camp.</li><li><strong>Two-year lifetime cap</strong>: each person may only enter two days in a lifetime (i.e., two years inside), more leads to dimensional rejection — typical artificial quota.</li><li><strong>Use-and-discard</strong>: temporarily used before each crisis, locked after crisis passes, never systematically turned into civilization&#39;s standing training facility.</li></ol><p>So, a divine artifact that could have rewritten the whole planet&#39;s power landscape is used as the protagonist&#39;s &quot;sprint room.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-three-accounts-of-time-waste" tabindex="-1">II. Three Accounts of Time Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-accounts-of-time-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Accounts of Time Waste&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Using the dual-track time domain&#39;s time economics to bill Dragon Ball:</p><ul><li><strong>Extremely low capacity</strong>: one room, two per entry, two years lifetime — this utilization, in the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s input-output table (Entry 504), is &quot;severe capacity idle.&quot; Acceleration law was built, yet 99% of the time idling.</li><li><strong>Dividends not spilling out</strong>: new moves Goku and Gohan practice in the chamber are only used in their 1v1s with strong enemies, never popularized into universal training methods. Earth&#39;s other warriors rely on &quot;fighting desperately in normal time,&quot; generations unable to catch up.</li><li><strong>Quota anti-humanity</strong>: &quot;only twice in a lifetime&quot; hard quota is not a law constraint, but plot need — to prevent the protagonist becoming invincible too early. This is precisely law-first axiom&#39;s warned &quot;plot-kidnapped setting&quot;: the setting, to serve wish-fulfillment rhythm, actively castrates the divine artifact&#39;s capacity.</li></ul><p>Heng Yuan Zhou judges: Dragon Ball&#39;s time waste is not &quot;not fast enough,&quot; but <strong>clearly has acceleration law, yet deliberately prevents it from being used well</strong>.</p><h2 id="iii-dual-alternative-turn-one-room-into-a-training-city" tabindex="-1">III. Dual Alternative: Turn One Room into a Training City <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-dual-alternative-turn-one-room-into-a-training-city" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Dual Alternative: Turn One Room into a Training City&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Anchor symbiosis&#39;s upgrade of the &quot;Hyperbolic Time Chamber&quot; is extending the single-point divine artifact into a networked acceleration-training system:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Hyperbolic Chamber</th><th>Origin Acceleration Domain Training System</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>One small room, two-person limit</td><td>Networked isolated spaces, multi-gears simultaneously serving Myriad-Rank warriors</td></tr><tr><td>Only twice in a lifetime</td><td>Contribution redeemed, more work more gain, allocated by need (Entry 504)</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist father-son exclusive</td><td>Real-name registration + ethical review, Myriad-Rank warriors equally apply</td></tr><tr><td>New moves privately retained</td><td>New moves enter Alaya Network, all may learn</td></tr><tr><td>Locked after use</td><td>Training data fed back, training plans continually iterated</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The core upgrade: <strong>from &quot;a sprint room locked up&quot; to &quot;a training city open to Myriad Ranks&quot;</strong>. The same time-acceleration law, utilization can rise hundredsfold to thousandfold.</p><h2 id="iv-boundary-with-acceleration-emptiness" tabindex="-1">IV. Boundary with &quot;Acceleration ≠ Emptiness&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-boundary-with-acceleration-emptiness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Boundary with &quot;Acceleration ≠ Emptiness&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>It is worth affirming that Goku&#39;s training in Dragon Ball is not empty — in the Time Chamber he truly trains, truly sweats, truly fights, not lying flat absorbing gongfu. This aligns with the dual-track time domain&#39;s &quot;accelerate but do not drain experience&quot; principle direction. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s criticism is not on &quot;acceleration&quot; itself, but on <strong>acceleration scope monopoly and capacity idle</strong>. The correct approach is to replicate Goku-style &quot;true training&quot; to Myriad Ranks, not keep the room locked behind the protagonist.</p><h2 id="brief-transition" tabindex="-1">Brief Transition <a class="header-anchor" href="#brief-transition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Brief Transition&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This also explains why Dragon Ball&#39;s acceleration device is ultimately replaced by the dual system: the Origin Acceleration Domain handles the &quot;fast&quot; part, the Quest Sediment Domain handles putting practiced gongfu into real trials to verify — Goku-style true-training spirit is retained, but that locked-up small room finally opens to Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Hyperbolic Time Chamber&#39;s acceleration law idles 99% of the time; divine-artifact capacity castrated by plot quota, the largest waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the acceleration chamber only serves the protagonist&#39;s camp; Earth&#39;s other warriors excluded from time dividends</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Dragon Ball&#39;s acceleration chamber and Tang-Luo&#39;s Matchless Academy are isomorphic — both &quot;divine artifact/academy + protagonist exclusive,&quot; differing only in packaging</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Origin Acceleration Domain open to Myriad-Rank warriors; any race may redeem training time by contribution</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: acceleration-training law, training data, new moves network-wide public; no &quot;twice in a lifetime&quot; artificial plot quota</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s Hyperbolic Time Chamber is the cross-heavens acceleration device closest to the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s ideal — it at least admits &quot;time can be accelerated.&quot; But its tragedy lies in: after being built, plot locked it, limited it, gave it only to the protagonist. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s dual-track time domain answers: since law allows acceleration, let acceleration serve Myriad Ranks; since acceleration does not drain experience, let Myriad Ranks all truly train. Turning a locked-up small room into a Myriad-Rank shared training city — this is what time-acceleration law should look like.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">Entry 16 · Multiplication Fruit Technical Principle</a> · <a href="./504_模块3-技术爆炸时间经济学.html">Entry 504 · Technical-Explosion Time Economics</a> · <a href="./501_模块3-双轨时间域总论.html">Entry 501 · Dual-Track Time Domain Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
